WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.803 --> 00:00:06.885
Today's 1 Minute Monday is "Do one thing".

00:00:06.885 --> 00:00:10.553
If you're starting up in any new project, you're going to be quickly overwhelmed by the

00:00:10.553 --> 00:00:12.092
number of options.

00:00:12.092 --> 00:00:14.976
There's so many things you have to do, so many ways to go

00:00:14.976 --> 00:00:17.556
that you don't end up doing anything.

00:00:17.556 --> 00:00:21.282
Pick one thing, focus on that and get it done.

00:00:21.282 --> 00:00:24.563
And you'll realize over the weeks that you are actually getting stuff done.

00:00:24.563 --> 00:00:28.152
This came as a result of a coaching call I had with my media coach,

00:00:28.152 --> 00:00:31.834
who gives me advice on how to make my YouTube videos better, radio shows better

00:00:31.834 --> 00:00:36.346
and last week she gave me... 30 different options of things that I need to work on.

00:00:36.346 --> 00:00:38.815
And they were all great, I need to work on them.

00:00:38.815 --> 00:00:42.065
But because they were so overwhelming, in the past week I did nothing,

00:00:42.065 --> 00:00:45.237
I didn't touch any of them, because it was too much.

00:00:45.237 --> 00:00:49.860
So I told her today on the call: "give me one thing, give me one assignment,

00:00:49.860 --> 00:00:53.673
I trust your judgement, give me one thing I need to work on and I´ll do it,

00:00:53.673 --> 00:00:58.801
I'll get it done!" And she said: "Ok, do a 1 Minute Monday, that's your project this week."

00:00:58.801 --> 00:01:01.321
So this is my 1 Minute Monday.

00:01:01.321 --> 00:01:05.983
If you have anything big and it's scary and overwhelming and preventing you from moving

00:01:05.983 --> 00:01:10.830
forward on taking action, pick one thing to do this week, follow through on it,

00:01:10.830 --> 00:01:14.480
and do one more next week, and one more next week until you get them all done.

00:01:14.480 --> 00:01:16.282
Believe!

00:01:16.282 --> 00:01:18.903
If you guys like this new format, let me know, give it a thumbs up,

00:01:18.903 --> 00:01:20.994
leave a comment. I'll see you soon!

00:01:25.000 --> 00:01:28.000
